* text=auto eol=lf
# 逐后缀单列：gitattributes 不支持 `{a,b}` 花括号展开——旧的三行合并写法整行是空操作
# （`git check-attr` 实测落 text: auto / binary: unspecified），80-check F3 机检「无花括号 + 二进制生效」。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.pdb binary
*.msi binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.bin binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.7z binary
